    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24045ee9bf492b04972b2bf3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊，训练员。我在玩神经衰弱哦。\r\n（神经衰弱：就是翻翻乐，一副扣着的牌翻出来两张相同的就拿走那个）",
      "source_fingerprint": "9115c303f9f00b07fe4ac74cdcecfebd77df2c7e7fef9a8d9059536f4b0ec1fa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
