    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f93b4c024433f60fd25cbfdf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我没有理会自己翻牌时无声铃鹿显得有些过激的反应，\r\n自顾自地将剩下的扑克牌一口气全都收走了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f9e87a581b8625acc50b2417683aeedf2f3bcc82e042e3d896594eb9d79407b",
